# Design System

Always use `AppColors` and `AppTheme` from `lich-plus/Core/Theme.swift`. Never hardcode colors, spacing, corner radii, or font sizes. Change tokens in `Theme.swift` so they propagate.

`Color` aliases: `.appPrimary`, `.appSecondary`, `.appAccent`, `.appBackground`, `.appTextPrimary`, `.appTextSecondary`.

```swift
// ❌ BAD
Text("Today")
    .foregroundStyle(Color.red)
    .padding(16)
    .background(Color(red: 251/255, green: 233/255, blue: 231/255))

// ✅ GOOD
Text("Today")
    .foregroundStyle(AppColors.primary)
    .padding(AppTheme.spacing16)
    .background(AppColors.backgroundLight)
```

Spacing tokens: `spacing2` … `spacing24`. Radii: `cornerRadiusSmall` (4) through `cornerRadiusXL` (16). Fonts: `fontCaption` … `fontLargeTitle`.
